# --- contextify's own state in THIS repo is committed on purpose ---
# .contextify/stamp.json and .contextify/evidence.json are tracked here: the repo dogfoods its
# own drift check, and a committed stamp is what lets every clone report "fresh" without a rerun.
# Target repos decide for themselves; `contextify init` recommends committing the stamp too.
# Only the local mistakes log stays private.
.contextify/mistakes.md

# --- run briefs and journals (local resumability only) ---
.goal/
docs/audit/

# --- OS / editor noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

# --- Tooling ---
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.cache/
.omc/
.claude/

# START contextify
.contextify/draft/
.contextify/journal.json
# END contextify
